commit 3fa210e6e57e56441b0b4b18a453413e5f2f2d71
Author: Uladzimir Klyshevich <Uladzimir_Klyshevich@epam.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 5 09:55:07 2026 +0300

    test health: lazy tracker in JSRunner, file_list/file_exists, deterministic retry, JS suite is a real gate (#635)

    - JSRunner: inject Provider<TrackerClient> and resolve it lazily; a missing
      tracker config no longer crashes tracker-less JS runs (agents unit suite).
    - FileTools: add the file_list and file_exists MCP tools the agents suite and
      docs already rely on (sandboxed like file_read; Dart port already has them).
    - RetryPolicy: a RestClientException is judged by status code/body, not by
      substrings of its message. The message embeds the request URL, so an
      ephemeral port such as 50312 matched '503' and retried a 400 five times
      (flaky JiraClientHttpCoverageTest.testExecuteGenericRequestStripsMissingKeyAndRetries).
    - unit-tests.yml: drop continue-on-error from the agents JS run/validate steps and
      propagate the runner exit code - green always, red blocks.
    - agents submodule -> latest main (with the suite fixes, IstiN/dmtools-agents#731).
    - Docs: file-tools reference + SKILL.md tool counts.

