/// Auth resolution (via [PropertyReader]):
/// `JIRA_EMAIL` + `JIRA_API_TOKEN` → `base64(email:token)`, or
/// `JIRA_LOGIN_PASS_TOKEN` as-is. The Authorization scheme comes from
/// `JIRA_AUTH_TYPE` (default `Basic`; `Bearer` for Server/DC PATs).
