///
/// Ports Java `BasicJiraClient` + `JiraClient.sign()` + `JiraClient.path()`:
/// auth header assembly, per-endpoint URL routing (`/rest/api/latest`,
/// `/rest/api/3`), and the `X-Atlassian-Token: nocheck` CSRF header.
