/// `CliCommandExecutor` parity exactly: the command is a full command LINE
/// whose first token is whitelisted (base set + `CLI_ALLOWED_COMMANDS`);
/// the line runs through a shell temp script (`/bin/sh`; `cmd.exe /c` on
